      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Invoice Extraction**\n\nI've just finished the initial setup for invoice field extraction, with the `extract_invoice_fields.py` file. I'm using Google Cloud Document AI as the external provider, as I previously planned. The code's already importing the necessary libraries for Document AI, initializing the client, and I've focused on extracting the vendor field so far.\n\n\n**Expanding Field Extraction**\n\nI've expanded the invoice field extraction in `extract_invoice_fields.py`. The initial focus on the vendor field is complete, and I've now integrated date, total, and individual line-item extraction. The code uses Google Cloud Document AI's client to process the documents and parse the relevant information from returned entities.\n\n\n",
